cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Leo-Q: Quantum-Secured LEO Satellite Network — .NET Simulation Framework"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of the Leo-Q quantum simulation framework supporting
  the paper "Leo-Q: Quantum-Secured Low Earth Orbit Satellite Network for
  High-Frequency Trading and Real-Time Portfolio Optimization" (IEEE Access,
  Manuscript ID 2026-10381). Provides four reproducible quantum experiments:
  QAOA portfolio optimization, QAE vs Monte Carlo VaR convergence analysis,
  LEO multi-hop latency budget analysis, and satellite QKD key rate modelling.
  All computation is performed via classical simulation of quantum circuits
  using .NET 8.
